(AGPL-3.0). See the LICENSE file for the full license text. The complete
corresponding source of WorkSuite Office is this repository and its
submodules.

Sinhala input (sinhala/wordlist) ranks and completes words with these
lists, merged as sinhala/wordlist/sources.json records:
- Sinhala Words List by slwdc (https://github.com/slwdc/Sinhala-Words-List),
  GPL-3.0; licence text in sinhala/wordlist/slwdc-LICENSE.txt
- Sinhala stopwords from Corpus-Sinhala-Redux by LIRNEasia
  (https://github.com/LIRNEasia/FacebookDecadeCorpora), CC BY 4.0:
  Wijeratne, Y., de Silva, N. (2020). Sinhala Language Corpora and Stopwords
  from a Decade of Sri Lankan Facebook. LIRNEasia.
Its candidate window follows the way Google Input Tools
(https://github.com/google/google-input-tools, Apache-2.0) works; no code or
data of it is used.
